      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Sec. 18-3. Vehicular hijacking."
    },
    {
      "type": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "text": "(a) A person commits vehicular hijacking when he or she knowingly takes a motor vehicle from the person or the immediate presence of another by the use of force or by threatening the imminent use of force."
    },
    {
      "type": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "text": "(b) Sentence. Vehicular hijacking is a Class 1 felony."
    },
    {
      "type": "source",
      "text": "(Source: P.A. 97-1108, eff. 1-1-13.)"
